msgid ""
"Add-on change history now retains only explicitly public configuration "
"values and marks changed credential fields as redacted."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Translator work reports with metrics can now be displayed and downloaded as "
"HTML."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Repository credentials are now consistently hidden from web and API output."
msgstr ""

